		<div class="feature">
			<div class="feature-left">
				<h2 id="tryon">
					Try on clothes
				</h2>
				<p>
					Take any outfit you like (like from Shein or Zara), save it or take a screenshot and paste it into Photo AI, press <span class="fake-button">👗 Try On Clothes</span> and it will dress your model with it. The new version of our try on model is better than ever and now even works with patterns and prints.
				</p>
				<br/>
				<p>
					Do entire photo shoots from your computer without having to fly around models and entire crews of photographers, light people, directors and producers half way around the world for a shoot. Just prompt the shoot design yourself, select your model and upload a piece of clothing!
				</p>
				<br/>
				<p>
