												<h4>
							How to create talking AI videos with Photo AI?						</h4>
						<div class="answer">
							<p>You can now create talking AI videos with Photo AI.</p><img src="https://fb-usercontent.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/0194ecff-6fc3-7ca0-bf2d-f031752d36ed.png" data-width="100%" data-align="left"><p>You first take an AI photo and then if you like the look of one, hover over the photo and tap [ Make video ]. It will then process for a few minutes and turn your AI photo into a lifelike moving AI video, like below.</p><p>Tip: if you want to make your video look sharper, first [ Upscale ] it before making a video. </p><video loading="lazy" controls loop muted src="https://fb-usercontent.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/0194ed00-9118-70bc-8e40-fbf347aa6d28.mp4" data-width="100%" data-align="left"></video><p>You can try a few times, and then when you have a video that you like the look of, again hover over it and tap [ Make talking video ].</p><p>A popup will show up to enter the script you want your AI model to speak.</p><img src="https://fb-usercontent.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/0194ed02-8beb-7e24-b813-91c86309f444.png" data-width="100%" data-align="left"><p>It will then start processing and after a few minutes, your talking AI video will show up in your gallery like this:</p><video loading="lazy" controls loop muted src="https://fb-usercontent.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/0194ed05-e3ea-7d65-8ace-3a87a010c760.mp4" data-width="100%" data-align="left"></video><p></p>						</div>
						<script type="application/ld+json">
							{
								"@context": "https://schema.org",
