												<h4>
							What payment methods do you accept?						</h4>
						<div class="answer">
							<p>We accept payments via credit or debit cards, including MasterCard, VISA, American Express, as well as iDeal, SOFORT, Bancontact, Przelewy24, Giropay, EPS, GrabPay, AliPay, and many more. </p><p>However, we do not accept PayPal or cryptocurrency and are not planning to right now.</p>						</div>
