												<h4>
							I cancelled Photo AI but am still being charged						</h4>
						<div class="answer">
							<p>In 100% of cases when this happens, you’ve signed up with a different email addresses and you canceled your subscription on one account. But there is still an ongoing subscription on the other.</p><p>To resolve this:</p><p>First find the right account email address by searching your inbox for emails from Stripe with subject “Your receipt from Photo AI” and see what email they are sent to.</p><p>Then go to <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer  " class="link" href="http://photoai.com/billing">photoai.com/billing</a> and log in with that email address. This is NOT the regular Photo AI login, this is specifically the login to the Stripe Customer Portal where you can self-manage your subscriptions.</p><p>Once inside there you’ll see your active subscriptions and can cancel them!</p><img src="https://fb-usercontent.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/01945693-98d6-7f15-9ccb-9222bcad7e3f.png" data-width="100%" data-align="left"><p></p>						</div>
